./ * HRC244DS - Add support for most of HNDIO from VM/ESA
./ *
./ * Update DEVTAB and User Interrupt Table references 
./ * to use the new DEVSECT DSECT. This update makes 
./ * structure or logic changes.  
./ *
./ * PREREQUISITES:
./ * none
./ *
./ * HISTORY:
./ * 29-Mar-2026 WDENTON  Initial version for VM370CE V1 R1.2
./ *
./ I 00126000 $ 00126100
         USING DEVSECT,R5                                      HRC244DS 00126100
./ R 00131000 $ 00131010 10
SRCHU    DS    0H                                              HRC244DS 00131010
         CL    R2,DEVNAME     Does symbolic name match?        HRC244DS 00131020
./ I 00133000 $ 00133100 50
         DROP  R5                                              HRC244DS 00133100
         USING DEVSECT,R9                                      HRC244DS 00133150
./ R 00135000 $ 00135010 10
SRCHR    DS    0H                                              HRC244DS 00135010
         CL    R2,DEVNAME     Does symbolic name match?        HRC244DS 00135020
./ R 00144000 00145000 $ 00144010 500
FOUND    DS    0H                                              HRC244DS 00144010
         OI    DEVFLAG,DEVPSDOW   Set pseudo-wait flag         HRC244DS 00144510
         TM    DEVFLAG,DEVINTR    Already received interrupt?  HRC244DS 00145010
./ R 00158000 $ 00158010
         TM    DEVFLAG,DEVINTP Has interrupt been processed?   HRC244DS 00158010
./ R 00162000 00163000 $ 00162010 1000
         MVC   IOOPSW+2(2),DEVIOPSW+2 Fill in dev addr         HRC244DS 00162010
         MVC   CSW,DEVCSW     and restore real CSW             HRC244DS 00163010
./ R 00167000 $ 00167010 100
         NI    DEVFLAG,255-DEVINTR-DEVINTP clr interrupt state HRC244DS 00167010
*                                                              HRC244DS 00167110
         DROP  R9                                              HRC244DS 00167210
./ I 00173000 $ 00173050
         USING DEVSECT,R5                                      HRC244DS 00173050
./ R 00174000 $ 00174010 10
OFFSTATU DS    0H                                              HRC244DS 00174010
         NI    DEVFLAG,255-DEVPSDOW    Clr all pseudo waits    HRC244DS 00174020
./ I 00175000 $ 00175100 50
         DROP  R5                                              HRC244DS 00175100
         USING DEVSECT,R9                                      HRC244DS 00175150
./ R 00177000 $ 00177010 10
OFFSTATR DS    0H                                              HRC244DS 00177010
         NI    DEVFLAG,255-DEVPSDOW    Clr all pseudo waits    HRC244DS 00177020
./ D 00183000 00194000
./ I 00207000 $ 00207050 
         DEVSECT ,                                             HRC244DS 00207050                                    
